<section id="reviews" style="background:var(--bg-soft)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow center"><span class="dot"></span> Why we built Vortiq</div>
      <h2>Made for the jobs you'd rather not do</h2>
      <p>We're a new brand — real customer reviews will appear here after launch. Here's why we built this in the meantime.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testi-grid reveal-stagger">
      <div class="testi-card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="margin-bottom:4px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div>
        <p class="testi-quote">"Grout shouldn't take a scrubbing brush and thirty minutes on your knees. Turbo mode is built to cut that down to a couple of minutes, standing up."</p>
        <div class="testi-person">
          <div><div class="testi-name">The Vortiq Team</div><div class="testi-role">Product design notes</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testi-card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="margin-bottom:4px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v3m0 12v3M3 12h3m12 0h3"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/></svg></div>
        <p class="testi-quote">"The telescopic handle exists because not everyone can (or wants to) bend over a bathtub. Reach the floor and the ceiling without a stool."</p>
        <div class="testi-person">
          <div><div class="testi-name">The Vortiq Team</div><div class="testi-role">Product design notes</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testi-card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="margin-bottom:4px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></div>
        <p class="testi-quote">"One handle, eight heads. Bathroom, kitchen, car, patio furniture — swap the head instead of buying five different tools."</p>
        <div class="testi-person">
          <div><div class="testi-name">The Vortiq Team</div><div class="testi-role">Product design notes</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

